{%- comment -%}
  ============ EDIT YOUR CONTENT HERE ============
  One stage per line, fields separated by |
  Format:  Label | Title | Description | Checklist item | Checklist item | ...
  (Add as many checklist items or lines/stages as you like.)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign heading = 'What to expect as support builds over time' -%}
{%- capture stages -%}
Week 1–2 | Easy Start | One capsule with breakfast. The enzyme begins circulating and going to work on fibrin. | One capsule a day, with food | No loading phase, no timing rules
Week 3–5 | Circulation Shifts | The first thing most people notice has nothing to do with a lab report. | Warmer hands and feet | Less heaviness in the legs
Week 6–12 | The Numbers Move | Ongoing support for healthy cholesterol levels starts showing up on paper.* | Support for your next blood panel* | Stairs and hills feel easier
Month 3–12 | The Long Game | The research that measured plaque reduction ran a full year. This is the stretch that mattered. | Continued fibrinolytic support* | A routine built on the mechanism, not the symptom
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- comment -%} Colors / font (optional) {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign bg_start = '#4f3a20' -%}
{%- assign bg_end = '#7d5a28' -%}
{%- assign accent = '#c9a24a' -%}
{%- assign pill_text = '#4a3418' -%}
{%- assign line_color = '#a88c66' -%}
{%- assign use_poppins = true -%}
{%- comment -%} ============ END OF EDITABLE AREA ============ {%- endcomment -%}

{%- if use_poppins -%}
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
{%- endif -%}
<style>
  .dpt-tl{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(135deg,{{ bg_start }} 0%,{{ bg_end }} 100%);color:#fff;padding:56px 20px 64px;overflow:hidden;{% if use_poppins %}font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;{% endif %}}
  .dpt-tl::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(-60deg,rgba(255,255,255,.06) 0 1px,transparent 1px 28px);pointer-events:none}
  .dpt-tl *{box-sizing:border-box}
  .dpt-tl__inner{position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}
  .dpt-tl__heading{color:#fff;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,44px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 32px}
  .dpt-tl__list{list-style:none;margin:0 auto;padding:0;max-width:880px}
  .dpt-tl__stage{position:relative;padding:0 0 44px 50px;margin:0}
  .dpt-tl__stage:last-child{padding-bottom:0}
  .dpt-tl__stage::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:11px;top:14px;bottom:-14px;width:2px;background:{{ line_color }}}
  .dpt-tl__stage:last-child::before{bottom:0}
  .dpt-tl__marker{position:absolute;left:0;top:4px;width:24px;height:24px;border:3px solid #fff;border-radius:3px;background:{{ bg_start }};z-index:1}
  .dpt-tl__pill{display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:{{ pill_text }};border-radius:4px;padding:11px 18px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:14px}
  .dpt-tl__pill span{color:{{ accent }}}
  .dpt-tl__desc{font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:.04em;margin:0 0 12px;color:#fff;opacity:.92}
  .dpt-tl__bullets{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
  .dpt-tl__bullet{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.5;margin:12px 0 0;color:#fff}
  .dpt-tl__bullet::before{content:"✓";color:{{ accent }};font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0}
  @media screen and (max-width:749px){
    .dpt-tl{padding:40px 16px 48px}
    .dpt-tl__heading{margin-bottom:24px}
    .dpt-tl__stage{padding:0 0 32px 38px}
    .dpt-tl__marker{width:20px;height:20px}
    .dpt-tl__stage::before{left:9px}
    .dpt-tl__pill{font-size:14px;padding:9px 14px}
    .dpt-tl__desc,.dpt-tl__bullet{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.02em}
    .dpt-tl__bullet{gap:10px}
  }
</style>

<div class="dpt-tl">
  <div class="dpt-tl__inner">
    {%- if heading != blank -%}<h2 class="dpt-tl__heading">{{ heading }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
    <ol class="dpt-tl__list">
      {%- assign stage_lines = stages | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
      {%- for line in stage_lines -%}
        {%- assign row = line | strip -%}
        {%- if row == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign parts = row | split: '|' -%}
        {%- assign label = parts[0] | strip -%}
        {%- assign title = parts[1] | strip -%}
        {%- assign desc = parts[2] | strip -%}
        <li class="dpt-tl__stage">
          <span class="dpt-tl__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div class="dpt-tl__pill">{% if label != blank %}<span>{{ label }}:</span> {% endif %}{{ title }}</div>
          {%- if desc != blank -%}<p class="dpt-tl__desc">{{ desc }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          {%- if parts.size > 3 -%}
            <ul class="dpt-tl__bullets">
              {%- for item in parts offset: 3 -%}
                {%- assign bullet = item | strip -%}
                {%- if bullet != blank -%}<li class="dpt-tl__bullet">{{ bullet }}</li>{%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          {%- endif -%}
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>
